  "description": "Built for the streets, boardwalks, and bike paths of Huntington Beach, the SKULLXBONES® 3-Speed Men's Beach Cruiser is the ultimate blend of style, comfort, and versatility. The custom pedal-forward ergonomic frame puts you in a natural, upright riding position — so every ride feels effortless, whether you're tackling a hill or gliding along the flat. Shimano Nexus 3-speed coaster brake gives you the gearing range to handle whatever the road throws at you, without sacrificing that classic cruiser simplicity.Wide 26\" x 50mm aluminum wheels with black stainless spokes resist corrosion and look sharp. The HBBC gel comfort seat keeps you riding mile after mile in total comfort. At HBBC, we take making the best beach cruiser bikes for men seriously — designing and manufacturing every product with quality and comfort as our top priority.Customize your ride with our bike accessories, or go further with our Electric Beach Cruisers.HBBC… Style Matters… Ride With Us!!Check out the entire SKULLXBONES® family of cruisers! Visit our flagship store — HB Easyrider at 328 Main Street in Downtown Huntington Beach!🛠️ Specs",
